  {
   "slug": "artists",
   "title": "Artists",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Every artist here draws their own designs and works by appointment, with regular walk-in days. Click through to their spotlight to see more.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"in-artists\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns in-artists\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"in-artist\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group in-artist\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:artist-mara}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"{{post:artist-spotlight-mara-vell}}\"><img src=\"{{media:artist-mara}}\" alt=\"Portrait illustration of artist Mara Vell in black and red\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:artist-mara}}\"/></a></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mara Vell</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"in-specialty\"} --><p class=\"in-specialty\">Bold traditional</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Twelve years tattooing. Books two months ahead, one walk-in day a month.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"in-artist\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group in-artist\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:artist-jonah}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"{{post:artist-spotlight-jonah-reyes}}\"><img src=\"{{media:artist-jonah}}\" alt=\"Portrait illustration of artist Jonah Reyes in black and green\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:artist-jonah}}\"/></a></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Jonah Reyes</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"in-specialty\"} --><p class=\"in-specialty\">Botanical fine line</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Consultation first, always. Books open on the first Monday of the month.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"in-artist\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group in-artist\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:piercing-tray}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:piercing-tray}}\" alt=\"Gold and steel piercing jewellery laid out on a dark tray\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:piercing-tray}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The piercing team</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"in-specialty\"} --><p class=\"in-specialty\">Piercing &amp; jewellery</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Walk-ins welcome Tuesday to Saturday. Free check-ups for life.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->",
   "template": "page-wide"
  },
  {
   "slug": "flash",
   "title": "Flash",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Flash is ready-drawn work at a set price. Each design on this page can be tattooed on a walk-in day; some can be resized or recoloured, just ask.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":4,\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"className\":\"in-flash\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-4 is-cropped in-flash\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:flash-dagger-rose}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:flash-dagger-rose}}\" alt=\"Flash design: a dagger through a red rose\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:flash-dagger-rose}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">€160</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:flash-swallow}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:flash-swallow}}\" alt=\"Flash design: a swallow in flight with a banner\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:flash-swallow}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">€140</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:flash-anchor}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:flash-anchor}}\" alt=\"Flash design: an anchor wrapped in rope\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:flash-anchor}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">€150</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:flash-heart}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:flash-heart}}\" alt=\"Flash design: a red heart with a blank banner\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:flash-heart}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">€120</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:flash-moon}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:flash-moon}}\" alt=\"Flash design: a crescent moon with a face and stars\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:flash-moon}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">€140</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:flash-snake}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:flash-snake}}\" alt=\"Flash design: a coiled green snake\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:flash-snake}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">€180</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:flash-eye}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:flash-eye}}\" alt=\"Flash design: an eye inside a triangle with rays\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:flash-eye}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">€150</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></figure><!-- /wp:gallery --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"in-note\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group in-note\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Prices are for the size shown on the sheet, roughly the size of a palm, and include aftercare balm.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "template": "page-wide",
   "parent": "artists"
  },
  {
   "slug": "booking",
   "title": "Booking",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We tattoo by appointment, with walk-in flash days announced in the journal. Booking takes three steps.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"className\":\"in-steps\"} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list in-steps\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Send us your idea, placement, size and budget through the contact details below.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Come in for a free consultation with your artist.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Pay a deposit to secure your session. It comes off the final price.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Prices</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"in-prices\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-table in-prices\"><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Minimum charge</td><td>€90</td></tr><tr><td>Flash (palm-sized)</td><td>from €120</td></tr><tr><td>Custom work</td><td>€140 per hour</td></tr><tr><td>Full day session</td><td>€800</td></tr><tr><td>Piercing (jewellery included)</td><td>from €45</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"in-note\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group in-note\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>You must be 18 or over with photo ID for tattoos. Deposits are kept if you cancel with less than 48 hours' notice.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Email the studio</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons -->",
   "featured_media": "studio-chair"
  },
  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Ink &amp; Needle opened in 2014 in a former print shop on Harrow Lane. We kept the old type cases on the wall and the habit of doing things carefully.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We are a small, friendly, private studio: two tattoo chairs, one piercing room and a kettle that is always on. Everyone is welcome, and nobody is ever rushed.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Good tattoos are not fast. They are careful, and they are done by people who like what they do.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Mara Vell, co-founder</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->",
   "featured_media": "machine"
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Contact",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Visit us at 14 Harrow Lane, Tuesday to Saturday, 11:00 to 20:00.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bookings</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>book@inkandneedle.example</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Piercing questions</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>pierce@inkandneedle.example</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Phone</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>+44 20 7946 0000</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Please include your idea, placement and rough size when you email. Photos help.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "parent": "about"
  }
 ],
 "posts": [
  {
   "slug": "friday-13th-flash-day",
   "title": "Friday the 13th flash day: thirteen designs, first come first served",
   "date": "2026-10-21T12:00:00",
   "excerpt": "Our favourite day of the year is back. Thirteen small designs, walk-ins only, from noon until we run out of ink.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Every Friday the 13th we pin a fresh flash sheet to the wall, open the doors at noon and tattoo walk-ins until the last appointment slot is gone. It is loud, it is busy, and it is the best day of the studio year.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>This time there are thirteen designs, all palm-sized, all drawn by our artists for the day. Each design is tattooed once, so if you see one you love, come early.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"className\":\"in-flash\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped in-flash\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:flash-dagger-rose}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:flash-dagger-rose}}\" alt=\"Flash design: a dagger through a red rose\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:flash-dagger-rose}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">€130</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:flash-swallow}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:flash-swallow}}\" alt=\"Flash design: a swallow in flight with a banner\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:flash-swallow}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">€113</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:flash-heart}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:flash-heart}}\" alt=\"Flash design: a red heart with a blank banner\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:flash-heart}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">€113</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></figure><!-- /wp:gallery --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How the day works</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"className\":\"in-steps\"} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list in-steps\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Arrive from noon and take a number at the desk.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Pick a design from the wall. Each one is tattooed once.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Wait in the café next door; we will text you.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Get tattooed, take your aftercare card, celebrate.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"in-note\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group in-note\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>You must be 18 or over and bring photo ID. We do not tattoo anyone who has been drinking.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Prices include a donation to the local animal shelter, as always. See you on the 13th.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "studio-news"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "flash",
    "events"
   ],
